              "value": "Key Weakness"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Jatembe's history of vanquishing the King of Biting Ants survives in the halcyon legacy of the Magaambya. The Aspect of Immortality has a key weakness to both arcane spells and primal spells."
